OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe cloud
OL,6,Fthickening with patchy rain at times
OL,7,Fduring this evening, skies then
OL,8,Fclearing overnight and turning chilly
OL,9,Fby dawn with a touch of frost possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,12,Fwith sunny spells, although there will
OL,13,Fbe a scattering of showers. Light or
OL,14,Fmoderate northwest winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FIt
OL,17,Fwill be mainly dry and settled as high
OL,18,Fpressure dominates. Mostly cloudy on
OL,19,FTuesday and Wednesday with patchy
OL,20,Flight rain or showers possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
